Based on GPL-licensed JTCommando by Jose Tejada / Jotego;
core source: https://github.com/jotego/jtcores
MRA derivation from jtcores_mister (2026), original XML GPLv2; retained
source provenance and applicable GPL notices in Commando_CRT/docs.
No promotional on-screen splash/credits are used; this comment is legal attribution.
THIS IS NOT A FUNCTIONAL RBF RELEASE AND DOES NOT CONTAIN ROMs.
-->
